{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<h2>日本爆紅瘦腿拖鞋</h2>\n<p>懶得做運動，但又想腿部線條變靚？日本品牌RADIANNE推出的「LumiStep美足健康拖鞋」近日在日本爆紅，被譽為「懶人美腿神器」。只需在家中穿著走動，便能同時保養雙腳、矯正站姿，一舉兩得。\n</p>\n<h2>分趾按摩＋矯正站姿</h2>\n<p>LumiStep採用專利「分趾墊」設計，一穿上去便會自然拉開腳趾、幫助伸展。鞋底更鋪滿立體按摩顆粒，每行一步都在刺激腳底穴位，猶如「走動式腳底按摩」，專治久站久坐引起的足部浮腫。LumiStep具備超強的立體足弓，穩穩Hold住腳底，幫助平衡體幹、改善站姿。穿著它在家中掃地、煮飯，不知不覺間便能鍛鍊體幹，修飾腿型。</p>\n<h2>5款顏色</h2>\n<p>鞋面採用SEBS高彈性軟膠，鞋底則是輕量EVA，質感親膚又耐用。最方便的是，這雙拖鞋可以隨時拆開直接用水洗，乾淨衛生，夏天穿也不怕有異味。推出5款顏色，包括灰黑、霧灰、玫瑰粉、灰紫及空氣藍，在日本售價為¥2,290，折合約港幣$120。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179586001498217393_3132553956b0aa62fb345e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179586001498217393_3132553956b0aa62fb345e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179586001754649337_6241755806b0aa63217175.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179586001754649337_6241755806b0aa63217175.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179586001977658176_10917827006b0aa634294e6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179586001977658176_10917827006b0aa634294e6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179586002171291077_5064920766b0aa63621d7d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179586002171291077_5064920766b0aa63621d7d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DgRxvC2CdEu/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T10:17:08.298293+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":505,"images":4,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T10:00:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T13:44:04.634716+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T10:10:45.935107+00:00","content_hash":"da2bd2963b39b04fcf10f66b03166d80b336e7b5d0fabda7688aea4621468b20","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}